1
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,280
Zhiyan,

2
00:00:58,799 --> 00:00:59,679
go open the door.

3
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:01,520
An important guest is coming.

4
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,079
An important guest?

5
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,159
Who could it be at this late hour?

6
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:13,680
Secondary consort,

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:14,560
move aside.

8
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:20,519
How dare you, daughter of a criminal,

9
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,959
return to the mansion?

10
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:24,599
Yes,

11
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,560
now that the Prime Minister's Residence has fallen,

12
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,599
I have nowhere to go.

13
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,920
I can only come back to seek Your Highness's protection.

14
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:34,200
Fortunately, Your Highness, out of old affection,

15
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,400
did not make things difficult for me.

16
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:40,079
Is there anything you need from me?

17
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:42,359
I'm in a hurry to serve Your Highness.

18
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,920
No matter how carefully you dress up,

19
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,400
you can't win His Highness's affection.

20
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,760
I advise you not to waste your efforts.

21
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,159
Is that so?

22
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,879
How would you know if you don't try?

23
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:56,400
You're just a pawn

24
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,359
in his hands.

25
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:58,719
When Prime Minister Shen falls,

26
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,079
he'll just discard you like an old shoe.

27
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,760
I advise you not to waste your efforts.

28
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:05,879
Don't get angry.

29
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,519
Come on.

30
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,200
Sit.

31
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:12,080
But I don't think so.

32
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:14,000
Look,

33
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:17,199
I'm still the principal consort of Prince Rui.

34
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,039
We're both pawns.

35
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:22,400
You're just a useless pawn that can be discarded at any time.

36
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:23,759
As for me,

37
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:25,719
if I'm discarded improperly,

38
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:28,080
he will lose everything.

39
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,199
Shen Suhe,

40
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:33,120
you were indeed useful

41
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,759
to His Highness in the past.

42
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,039
But times have changed.

43
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:38,759
The Prime Minister's Residence has fallen.

44
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,199
You may not

45
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:42,439
even get a chance to serve.

46
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:45,479
You'd better leave the mansion.

47
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:46,800
Otherwise...

48
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,120
Otherwise what?

49
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,360
Otherwise I'll...

50
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,400
You...

51
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,879
What are you doing?

52
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:55,960
Look.

53
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,560
What a beautiful body.

54
00:03:00,199 --> 00:03:02,199
It'd be a pity to ruin it.

55
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,479
How about

56
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,360
I sell you to a brothel?

57
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:07,280
You should fetch a good price.

58
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,319
Do you think

59
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,840
His Highness will pay a fortune

60
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:13,280
to redeem you?

61
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,120
How dare you!

62
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,919
My mother died of poisoning,

63
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:22,199
my father was wrongfully imprisoned,

64
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:24,520
and our entire family was ruined!

65
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,400
Now,

66
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,199
I just want to send

67
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,159
those who have harmed me

68
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:34,199
and my family to hell.

69
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:35,800
Ling Chuchu,

70
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:38,240
I dare.

71
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,000
Shen Suhe,

72
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:43,680
I didn't harm your family.

73
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,120
Look at you.

74
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:55,919
Don't worry.

75
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,719
Mu Jinghao cherishes you so much.

76
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,319
If I hurt you,

77
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:01,120
I won't be able to stay here.

78
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,680
Shen Suhe,

79
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,080
you're a madwoman.

80
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,080
Don't worry,

81
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,280
I won't let you stay here.

82
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,479
I'm waiting for you.

83
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,759
My Lady,

84
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,279
we're already

85
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,879
struggling here.

86
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:22,439
Why did you mess with Ling Chuchu?

87
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,959
Because we're in a tough situation,

88
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,759
we need to use this pawn.

89
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:33,959
Zhiyan,

90
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,600
grind the ink for me.

91
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:36,480
Ink?

92
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:37,720
Okay.

93
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,360
Miss,

94
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,759
it's not the time

95
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,959
to read this novel.

96
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:15,120
A love letter

97
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,920
from the prince on the border

98
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,879
from the frontier.

99
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,319
How's that?

100
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,680
Royal gossip.

101
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,680
Isn't it exciting?

102
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,839
Miss,

103
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,800
what are you going to do?

104
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,959
Now that I'm back to the mansion,

105
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,759
although the Second Prince dares not deal with me openly,

106
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:38,720
he may

107
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,160
take action against me secretly.

108
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,399
So,

109
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,639
I need to find a reason

110
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,279
to make him hesitate to hurt me.

111
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:45,959
Prince Yu,

112
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,720
you won't return to the capital anyway,

113
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:49,560
why not help me

114
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,800
get rid of those two?

115
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,360
What are you waiting for?

116
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,920
Hurry up!

117
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,600
Now,

118
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:56,839
take this script out,

119
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,480
Find the bookstores

120
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,199
and peddlers.

121
00:05:59,199 --> 00:05:59,879
Within two days,

122
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,480
make sure this book is widely distributed.

123
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:02,160
At any cost.

124
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,639
Miss,

125
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,199
this is absolutely not acceptable.

126
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,680
If this book gets out,

127
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,839
what will happen to your reputation?

128
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,680
Reputation or life, which is more important?

129
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,040
Reputation

130
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,040
or my father's life,

131
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:16,959
my brother's life,

132
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:18,439
and the entire mansion's future?

133
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:21,199
I've heard that

134
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:22,680
Prince Yu

135
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:24,600
is a ruthless demon.

136
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,000
If he hears about this...

137
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:29,439
He's far away at the border.

138
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,720
He won't hear about these trivial matters.

139
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:31,600
Listen to me,

140
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,600
just go ahead and do it.

141
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,199
Moreover,

142
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:42,439
his shadow guard approached me for cooperation.

143
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:45,079
Even if he finds out one day,

144
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,319
Lou Xi can be used as a shield.

145
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:48,879
New novels.

146
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:49,600
Your business is good.

147
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,399
Help me sell more.

148
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:50,759
Okay.

149
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:51,879
Do you want to read novels?

150
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,399
Thank you.

151
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,120
Come on.

152
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:54,879
New book for free!

153
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,879
These few books.

154
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,120
Are they all given away?

155
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:57,879
Okay.

156
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,120
New book!

157
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,240
Thank you.

158
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,519
New book!

159
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,759
New story!

160
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,360
Are they all given away?

161
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,040
Thank you.

162
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,480
New novels.

163
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,319
These are the new stories.

164
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:10,120
Have you finished?

165
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:10,959
The last one.

166
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,439
Prince.

167
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,839
Prince's love letter to his capital beloved.

168
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:26,240
A love letter from a thousand miles away.

169
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,120
Good.

170
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:36,480
How dare you be so bold.

171
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:37,759
Prince.

172
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,600
have we been exposed?

173
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:41,959
You...

174
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,399
You're not like what the book said,

175
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,360
to be with Princess Consort of Rui...

176
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:46,920
How dare you!

177
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,519
Before it gets out,

178
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:51,519
collect all the books!

179
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,519
I'm afraid it's too late.

180
00:07:55,199 --> 00:07:58,120
Almost everyone has a copy.

181
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,319
Shen Suhe,

182
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,360
what do you want?

183
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,800
What are you doing here?

184
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,560
The princess consort is asleep.

185
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,399
I'm not here for her,

186
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,560
but for you.

187
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,360
It's about to change seasons.

188
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:28,120
The mansion has bought some bedding for her.

189
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:30,600
You need to get them from the warehouse.

190
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,799
Now?

191
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,960
But it's already night.

192
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,480
I've told you.

193
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,240
It's up to you to go or not.

194
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,759
Don't say that our mansion

195
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,799
has mistreated your master.

196
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,320
I see.

197
00:08:48,639 --> 00:08:49,679
I'll go with you.

198
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:16,919
Everything is inside.

199
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,240
Go in and get it.

200
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:21,080
Where is it?

201
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,399
Why are you locking the door?

202
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,360
Open it for me.

203
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,600
Rui'er

204
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,960
- Let me out! - Rui'er!

205
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,039
Open the door!

206
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:50,480
What a lucky guy!

207
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,960
Princess consort,

208
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:54,679
don't blame me.

209
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,320
You filthy bastard!

210
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,559
How dare you!

211
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,320
You're still awake?

212
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,559
What did you do to me?

213
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,519
You'll know when you wake up.

214
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:21,679
I was instigated by the secondary consort.

215
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,399
If you go to hell,

216
00:10:24,399 --> 00:10:25,559
don't blame me.

217
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,279
Shen Suhe,

218
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,720
why are you here?

219
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:48,879
Why is it so quiet in the mansion?

220
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,480
Yeah.

221
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:12,919
Princess Consort of Rui,

222
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:14,720
what a beautiful woman!

223
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:15,919
Miss,

224
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,639
don't joke with me.

225
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:18,480
Remember,

226
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,080
You only have two hours.

227
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,919
Just leave her one breath.

228
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:23,480
Yes.

229
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:27,919
If it wasn't me,

230
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:28,960
you would have been choked to death.

231
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:31,639
That's not the case.

232
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,960
It's just that the drug took effect a little slowly.

233
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:36,720
I can hold on a little longer.

234
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,679
And

235
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:42,000
I just don't want to see blood

236
00:11:42,519 --> 00:11:43,279
and ruin the plan.

237
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:44,799
What plan?

238
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,279
You're here so late,

239
00:11:58,519 --> 00:11:59,519
do you need something from me?

240
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:01,879
Yes,

241
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,399
did you write this script?

242
00:12:08,639 --> 00:12:09,600
It was a temporary measure.

243
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:10,679
I'll explain everything

244
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,559
to you later.

245
00:12:21,559 --> 00:12:22,879
Since you're here,

246
00:12:23,279 --> 00:12:24,759
could you do me a favor?

247
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:26,519
Alright,

248
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,759
you explain to me

249
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:29,559
about the novel first,

250
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:30,919
then I decide whether to help you.

251
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,159
Please.

252
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:34,919
Just help me.

253
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:37,200
I promise to explain it to you later.

254
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:37,679
Okay?

255
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,480
Let go of your hands first.

256
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,720
Promise me first.

257
00:12:43,639 --> 00:12:44,120
Then...

258
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:48,039
Remember that you owe me an explanation.

259
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:49,799
I will.

260
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,279
Somebody, help!

261
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,879
There's a thief in the mansion!

262
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,559
Somebody, help!

263
00:12:56,559 --> 00:12:57,919
There's a thief in the mansion!

264
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,480
Your Highness, something's wrong!

265
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:01,759
I just saw a shadow

266
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,360
sneaking into the mansion.

267
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:03,879
Where is he?

268
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,960
I saw him sneak into the room over there.

269
00:13:07,879 --> 00:13:09,279
What's the noise?

270
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,519
In the middle of the night.

271
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:11,799
Is there a thief?

272
00:13:13,279 --> 00:13:14,360
Princess Consort

273
00:13:25,559 --> 00:13:26,480
You wait outside.

274
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:27,840
Without my order,

275
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:28,919
you are not allowed to enter.

276
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:29,720
Yes.

277
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:41,759
This...

278
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,039
What's going on?

279
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,120
If this gets out,

280
00:13:44,399 --> 00:13:45,960
it will be bad for our reputation.

281
00:13:50,759 --> 00:13:51,480
Your Highness.

282
00:14:02,159 --> 00:14:02,759
Your Highness.

283
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,120
I did nothing.

284
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,159
I'm innocent.

285
00:14:06,919 --> 00:14:08,639
It must be Shen Suhe who did this.

286
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:17,960
Damn it.

287
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:18,799
Get up.

288
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,279
Explain to Your Highness.

289
00:14:20,279 --> 00:14:21,480
Nothing happened between us.

290
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:28,000
Your Highness.

291
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:28,759
Your Highness.

292
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:30,440
It's her.

293
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,279
It's the princess consort.

294
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:33,120
It's the princess consort who asked me to serve her.

295
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:33,799
Then

296
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:35,360
I was knocked out.

297
00:14:35,519 --> 00:14:36,840
When I woke up, I was lying here.

298
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,279
Your Highness.

299
00:14:52,399 --> 00:14:52,840
Your Highness.

300
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:54,000
You must believe me.

301
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,159
I'm innocent.

302
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,440
It's Shen Suhe.

303
00:14:57,759 --> 00:14:59,120
She set me up.

304
00:14:59,200 --> 00:14:59,759
Get away.

305
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,799
Shen Suhe,

306
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:04,720
don't think I don't know

307
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,840
you're behind this.

308
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,159
Your Highness,

309
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,919
convicting someone requires evidence.

310
00:15:08,919 --> 00:15:10,159
I'm warning you for the last time.

311
00:15:10,799 --> 00:15:12,320
Stop playing these boring tricks.

312
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:13,519
Otherwise,

313
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,240
I can't guarantee

314
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,919
your father's safety in prison.

315
00:15:20,159 --> 00:15:20,720
Your Highness.

316
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,080
Your Highness.

317
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,720
I'm innocent.

318
00:15:36,919 --> 00:15:38,240
If you still don't want to see me,

319
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:40,000
I'll keep kneeling here

320
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:42,120
until you forgive me.

321
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,159
Your Highness.

322
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:47,000
Please open the door and see me.

323
00:15:48,799 --> 00:15:49,720
Your Highness.

324
00:15:52,559 --> 00:15:53,320
Miss.

325
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,000
You've been kneeling all night.

326
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,320
Take care of yourself.

327
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:57,720
Get away.

328
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,360
You useless thing.

329
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:00,639
If it weren't for you,

330
00:16:00,639 --> 00:16:01,840
would I have to suffer such humiliation?

331
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,200
It's all my fault.

332
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,759
Please

333
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:07,759
to make up for my mistake.

334
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,159
You are just a lowly servant,

335
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,399
how can you make up for it?

336
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:18,799
Miss,

337
00:16:28,519 --> 00:16:29,080
where did you get

338
00:16:29,519 --> 00:16:30,279
this thing?

339
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,919
I found it when I went out shopping today.

340
00:16:33,399 --> 00:16:35,320
This book has been all over the city.

341
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,799
Everyone is saying that

342
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:37,600
the princess consort in it

343
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,080
is the one in our mansion.

344
00:16:41,639 --> 00:16:42,840
You are useful.

345
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,360
Now,

346
00:16:44,759 --> 00:16:45,919
send it to the palace.

347
00:16:46,279 --> 00:16:47,519
Make sure to give it to my aunt.

348
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,200
Yes.

349
00:16:53,559 --> 00:16:54,559
Shen Suhe,

350
00:16:55,559 --> 00:16:56,480
I don't believe

351
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:59,600
you can stay in the mansion this time.

352
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,759
Shen Suhe,

353
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,599
I want to see

354
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,440
how long you can hold on.

355
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,119
I'll stay here

356
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,440
as long as I live.

357
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,519
If you dare, just kill me.

358
00:17:19,519 --> 00:17:20,559
Do you think I dare not?

359
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:23,200
You are a bad woman,

360
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,079
and you even disturbed my parents.

361
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:27,599
It's not too much to kill you.

362
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:30,400
I'm a bad woman?

363
00:17:33,119 --> 00:17:34,640
What about your concubine?

364
00:17:35,799 --> 00:17:37,119
You saw her

365
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:40,519
having an affair with another man.

366
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,279
Should she be killed too?

367
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:44,200
You!

368
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:46,720
What a large mansion!

369
00:17:47,799 --> 00:17:50,400
What a high and mighty Prince!

370
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,400
Now, you've made such a big joke.

371
00:17:54,319 --> 00:17:56,400
I wonder what people are saying about you.

372
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,079
Are they saying

373
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,720
you're weak and incompetent,

374
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:02,440
unable to discipline your wives and concubines,

375
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,440
or are they saying

376
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,200
you're tolerant and magnanimous,

377
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:09,000
allowing them to live in a sinful way under your nose?

378
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,519
Shut up!

379
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:10,480
Beat him!

380
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:11,799
Beat him until he begs for mercy!

381
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:15,559
His Majesty's oral edict!

382
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:23,079
Your Royal Highness,

383
00:18:24,519 --> 00:18:25,519
what brings you here

384
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,799
today?

385
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,119
His Majesty's oral edict.

386
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,160
His Majesty heard that

387
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:33,240
Princess Consort of Rui has misconducted,

388
00:18:33,599 --> 00:18:35,680
which damaged the royal family's reputation.

389
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:36,920
Therefore,

390
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,839
Princess Consort of Rui shall move out of the mansion immediately,

391
00:18:40,079 --> 00:18:42,200
and go to Lingguo Temple to reflect on herself.

392
00:18:42,519 --> 00:18:44,799
She can't leave without an imperial edict.

393
00:18:45,839 --> 00:18:46,599
Princess Consort of Rui,

394
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,160
please.
